                    "line": 771,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "priyaram",
                        "email": "priyangaramasamy2@gmail.com",
                        "username": "PriyangaRamasamy"
                    },
                    "message": "why are you storing keyword name in a vector?\nin line 788 why are you converting the vector elements to string for comparison?\n\ninstead store it in string."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/utility/vpd_specific_utility.hpp",
                    "line": 771,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Anupama B R",
                        "email": "anupama.b.r1@ibm.com",
                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "the read API takes a address, as we know keyword size is two, so allocating that size. converting vector to string will also help in using == operator for direct comparison."
                }
